# BullMQ Worker Conventions

Each queue has a dedicated processor class in `src/workers/`.
Use `BullModule.registerQueue()` in the worker module.
Set `removeOnComplete: 10` and `removeOnFail: 5` to prevent Redis bloat.
Retry policy: 3 retries, exponential backoff starting at 30s.

Critical queues (sms-dispatch, sla-monitor) get 5 retries, 10s fixed backoff.
Never throw unhandled errors — always catch and log to the structured logger.
